nment  now to share the connector with other  users you also need to get the correct  deployment link open your connector in  Apps Script environment click on publish  from the menu and select apply from  manifest this will show you a list of  all deployments for your connector we  will cover versioning and deployments in  a separate video  from this interface copy the appropriate  deployment link and share it with others  you can share the link through email  social media or your own blog anyone who  goes to this deployment link will be  able to use your connector configure it  connect to their own Google feed data  and create their own separate dashboards  that's pretty neat you can get greater  visibility for your connector by  publishing it to the data Studio  connector gallery if the connector gets  published all data studio users will be  able to view the connector while  exploring or searching through the  gallery you can publish your connector  in two ways either as a Parker connector  or as an open-source connector if you  publish as a partner connector you will  need to support and deploy and maintain  the connector yourself you can follow  the partner connector guidelines and  submit a review request to get started  if the connector passes the review it'll  be included in the gallery as a partner  connector publishing in this way helps  you and your organization to get more  exposure add your own branding and also  monetize your connector on the other  hand you can publish as an open-source  connector in that case the connector is  deployed by the data studio devrel team  and supported by the community you can  start the process by submitting a pull  request to our repository link is in the  description once the pull request is  approved your connector will be  showcased in the gallery as an  open-source connector this is a great  way for you to showcase your code  publishing your connector helps to get  better visibility reach a bigger  audience and provide better value to  your existing users you also become  eligible to be considered for  promotional activities so we recommend  that if you build a connector you should  publish it  however keep in mind that you don't have  to publish to share your connector with  others you can share by link even  without publishing and then just give  the deployment URL to users hopefully  you find this sharing and publishing  overview for community collectors useful  you can always go to our developer site  at developers.google.com/live ater  studio for more information if you like  this video stay tuned on the GCP channel  for more data store your content thanks  for watching  [Music]  [Applause]
 

